<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem $10 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem $10 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said Thursday that on October 24 it will redeem all outstanding amounts of a $10 million, 7.09 percent fixed-rate debenture series due August 21, 2000.</p>
<p>The cusip number for the debentures is 3134A0HG0.</p>
<p>Payment of the principal plus interest accrued on the outstanding principal amount to the redemption date shall be made to the debenture holders on the book and records of a Federal Reserve bank as of close of business October 23, Freddie Mac said.</p>
</text>
